{"title":"캐릭캐릭 체인지! 신장판","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=kislt/hAd4gmZrGz/PjkwjguiALezfmk0JDrhF0&filename=th3","synopsis":"★디지털 한정 컬러 일러스트 페이지 수록!★\n\n수호 캐릭터는 '되고 싶은 내 모습'이야.\n\n아무가 ‘되고 싶은 나 자신으로 다시 태어나고 싶어’라고 소원을 빌자, \n세 개의 알에서 ‘수호 캐릭터’가 탄생했다! \n심지어 수호 캐릭터의 주인들로 구성된 세이요 초등학원의 가디언으로 임명되기까지….\n\n2006년부터 ‘나카요시’에서 연재되고 \nTV 애니메이션으로 만들어져 인기를 얻은 전설의 히트작이 신장판으로 등장.\n그때, 용기를 얻었다. 지금 다시 한번 용기를 얻으리라. \n모든 소녀들을 응원하는 미라클 판타지.\n\nⓒ PEACH-PIT / Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":278,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":230,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":214,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":210,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":279,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":55}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":205,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":220,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":268,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":249,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":288,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":280,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":248,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":288,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":226,"change":{"type":"up","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":242,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":268,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":235,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},